@startuml
title Semana 7 - Diseño de componentes y refactorizacion\nCatalogo de Medicamentos

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Usuario Web" as WebUser
actor "Cliente API" as ApiClient

package "Presentation" {
    component "public/index.php\nEntrada web" as WebEntry
    component "Vista catalogo\ncatalog.php" as CatalogView
    component "assets\napp.js + styles.css" as Assets
    component "MedicationWebRequest" as WebRequest
    component "MedicationController" as WebController
    component "public/api.php\nEntrada REST" as ApiEntry
    component "MedicationApiController" as ApiController
}

package "Application" {
    component "RegisterMedication" as Register
    component "SearchMedications" as Search
    component "GetMedication" as Get
    component "ToggleMedicationStatus" as Toggle
    component "ChangeMedicationStatus" as Change
}

package "Domain" {
    component "Medication" as Medication
    component "MedicationStatus" as Status
    interface "MedicationRepository" as Repository
}

package "Persistence" {
    component "PdoMedicationRepository" as PdoRepository
    component "InMemoryMedicationRepository" as MemoryRepository
    component "DatabaseConnection" as DatabaseConnection
}

database "SQLite" as SQLite

WebUser --> WebEntry : HTTP / formulario
WebEntry --> WebRequest : crea con datos HTTP
WebRequest --> WebController : entrada normalizada
WebController --> CatalogView : datos de vista
CatalogView --> Assets : carga
CatalogView --> WebUser : HTML

ApiClient --> ApiEntry : HTTP + JSON
ApiEntry --> ApiController : ruta y entrada

WebController --> Register : alta
WebController --> Search : busqueda
WebController --> Toggle : alternar vigencia

ApiController --> Register : alta
ApiController --> Search : busqueda
ApiController --> Get : consulta por id
ApiController --> Change : cambiar vigencia

Register --> Medication : crea
Register --> Repository : consulta / agrega
Search --> Repository : busca
Get --> Repository : consulta
Toggle --> Medication : consulta vigencia
Toggle --> Status : estado opuesto
Toggle --> Repository : consulta / actualiza
Change --> Status : valida estado
Change --> Repository : consulta / actualiza
Medication --> Status : conserva estado

PdoRepository ..|> Repository
MemoryRepository ..|> Repository
PdoRepository --> DatabaseConnection : usa PDO
DatabaseConnection --> SQLite : conecta
PdoRepository --> SQLite : SQL parametrizado

note right of WebRequest
Refactor de Semana 7:
encapsula lectura y conversion
de la entrada HTTP web.
end note

note right of WebController
Coordina Application y la vista.
No contiene SQL.
end note

note bottom of Medication
Las reglas de campos obligatorios,
estado, vigencia y seleccion
permanecen en Domain.
end note

note bottom of Repository
Application depende del contrato.
Persistence proporciona
las implementaciones.
end note

@enduml
